{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Father of dwelling in tent and livestock.</b> Rashi's comment: a midrash aggadah — he built houses for idol worship, as it is written: ״סמל הקנאה המקנה״. That is, מקנה here is interpreted like המקנה there, for both are written with a heh. <b>[</b> And according to its plain sense: tents of sheep.]"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:58.139026015Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}